For OS9/68000 only.Use 'uld' and 'dld'' from a remote system to upload (uld) ordownload (dld) using the XMODEM protocol.For example to upload a file you would do this from OSK:$ uld <filename>Then from your remote system start an XMODEM upload.uld version 1.4   (c) 1986 FHLSyntax: uld <file>Function: upload to <file> using XMODEM protocoldld version 1.4   (c) 1986 FHLSyntax: dld <file>Function: download from <file> using XMODEM protocolBoth 'uld' and 'dld' are part of the QCom package from FHL.They are not freeware or shareware or public domain. Howeveryou may freely distribute them as long as this file is included.Contact FHL for more information.Frank Hogg Laboratory, Inc.204 Windemere Rd.Syracuse NY 13205Tel: 315/469-7364Fax: 315/469-8537Delphi: FHOGG   CIS: 70310,317